                <l xml:id="m-28279804-83d0-4033-b697-c4853fdb5442" facs="#m-0f359f1a-4b1f-4a27-a6c9-b0810e9d2d5c" label="text-like">At Matins.</l><l xml:id="m-5f5e7541-94bd-4bc0-b4c4-7ed05816f66a" facs="#m-3816177a-0758-46a0-87f0-0a82681ae406" label="ambiguous">033</l><l xml:id="m-f7fcb3fc-2ce3-42d5-bfcd-15f73b30a9c7" facs="#m-1c7f737c-ab59-41c6-a196-c5c1f1bcefba" label="lyrics-like">in mé-o sánguine: "Hoc fá¬</l><l xml:id="m-45a711c4-687b-41df-9b8d-6b2e8793c5a7" facs="#m-2ddc5cb4-f105-4735-ae50-1ae04e7c05c2" label="ambiguous">ci-te</l><l xml:id="m-4c7f46cf-de8b-4936-a66b-ded3b0cc3b21" facs="#m-116aed3a-6358-478b-97d9-17b6290f3d68" label="ambiguous">tum est</l><l xml:id="m-ed7f925f-4ae4-4667-afa4-a7edab57612d" facs="#m-f80abb2f-c81e-40b9-998b-5c9300834061" label="lyrics-like">ó¬</l><l xml:id="m-897d0f21-8146-4366-8115-1fa254c9ba76" facs="#m-2b75612d-d473-4afc-95a7-e6833d429ef9" label="lyrics-like">in mé¬</l><l xml:id="m-a413497c-b37b-4cae-a237-aa85ebcfbbe6" facs="#m-ad465ec5-30cb-4d31-a39d-ee5b6fba43bc" label="ambiguous">am commemo-ra¬ ti¬</l><l xml:id="m-3fdb463d-003b-495a-ab2e-6afa67a0ccae" facs="#m-76a689c8-f24a-48a3-b11b-87c75c50d417" label="ambiguous">nem.</l><l xml:id="m-b3343840-c19b-46b1-b238-7e7922448631" facs="#m-f09611bb-e275-4ffe-8f2c-fabc6fdb15e1" label="lyrics-like">V. Memó-ri-a mé- mor é- ro, et ta-bé- scet in me</l><l xml:id="m-996353af-feb6-4f36-bae4-4b6949c2a39e" facs="#m-45c999d0-cb0f-4e0c-91f1-d4390dbd90c0" label="lyrics-like">á-ni-ma mé¬ a. "Hoc.</l><l xml:id="m-7c7ce6e9-6b9d-42f7-ac87-5e910edcf387" facs="#m-dfb8219d-2f48-434b-aa2e-3b3c3895b282" label="lyrics-like">The Lector: Jube, domne, benedícere.</l><l xml:id="m-9807e636-baf5-4dfd-b2b2-ad38864141f0" facs="#m-3ab9be64-aa71-4670-a861-042ea0a7249f" label="lyrics-like">Blessing: Ignem sui amóris * accéndat Deus in córdibus nostris.</l><l xml:id="m-896e61cb-8401-493c-ba05-c998bb3cfaab" facs="#m-0764e909-f1a1-47c1-bab4-c4288c2bc391" label="ambiguous">R. Amen.</l><l xml:id="m-42fa7815-6d19-4a70-ab2a-7ef9fec1cc6f" facs="#m-27e17767-d620-40c5-8d56-b229180a5cb2" label="ambiguous">Lesson VI.</l><l xml:id="m-bb1f802c-705a-4fea-bc20-1fbf86b47a8f" facs="#m-6e654a18-ca26-4b92-b2db-710c63cdf963" label="lyrics-like">Ullum étiam sacraméntum est vit, excellentíssimae caritátis. Unde,</l><l xml:id="m-317f0178-8909-41d2-ba68-eccad45278b5" facs="#m-20d8473b-1a3d-4451-a5b9-d07a44116f61" label="lyrics-like">1L isto salúbrius, quo purgántur lut árctius hujus caritátis immén¬</l><l xml:id="m-77d3aa3f-6c3a-4d67-ad31-57805b536fff" facs="#m-4796ef27-e694-43a5-b0a3-6fef2b096343" label="lyrics-like">sitas fidélium córdibus infigerétur,</l><l xml:id="m-5f3624f4-b2af-4ae0-91d0-91775741573b" facs="#m-541f6609-696a-47b5-937f-dde6ff9976ba" label="lyrics-like">peccáta, virtútes augéntur, et mens</l><l xml:id="m-43525005-ceae-4e51-9454-36990380b73c" facs="#m-2909d0b3-2f8d-40a6-8ae6-1d7fde594e52" label="lyrics-like">ómnium spirituálium charismatum lin última coena, quando Pascha</l><l xml:id="m-0e81807d-def3-4b8d-bbe4-1d3251628bba" facs="#m-c9400327-6b54-480e-a965-345caadbcf94" label="lyrics-like">cum discipulis celebráto, transi¬</l><l xml:id="m-621e338c-f089-4571-a66b-f1b14185572f" facs="#m-34d7cb16-356b-4809-9b2e-d400cbadaa2a" label="lyrics-like">abundántia impinguátur. Offértur</l><l xml:id="m-7092eb2e-4817-4f3c-b7fa-469326b8188d" facs="#m-6af5ed26-183c-40ff-be21-abd63b2db05f" label="lyrics-like">túrus erat de hoc mundo ad Pa¬</l><l xml:id="m-29449623-e2b0-4e9f-90e2-44201360814e" facs="#m-0e2179bb-4de7-498e-8963-5b383d4499ae" label="lyrics-like">in Ecclésia pro vivis et mórtuis, ut</l><l xml:id="m-b7a387e6-04c6-4a9c-acf4-ad2c125205eb" facs="#m-dfa519e9-a181-4b63-9aec-7063ed4f8919" label="lyrics-like">trem, hoc Sacraméntum instituit,</l><l xml:id="m-764a2280-d355-41b4-9af7-8258bf66599e" facs="#m-d3b9fae3-1442-4d13-95b7-af5bf2179bb4" label="lyrics-like">ómnibus prosit, quod est pro salúte</l><l xml:id="m-653b5b34-89ed-43ab-9175-5af00786e771" facs="#m-62430de1-137e-4fe6-8e8f-1dde0624abc5" label="lyrics-like">tanquam passiónis suae memoriále</l><l xml:id="m-8ffa0a70-913c-497c-9783-4102a5451c3a" facs="#m-01a6d87e-7bbc-446c-97e3-97d10d409061" label="lyrics-like">ómnium institútum. Suavitátem</l><l xml:id="m-a1b41add-1ad5-4914-85c0-17338b2aad3d" facs="#m-31195265-4df5-42e8-a32f-2538d3fef911" label="lyrics-like">dénique hujus Sacraménti nullus</l><l xml:id="m-710b092b-4c71-4181-918a-d6428589c62b" facs="#m-b29ed33f-ed68-4d2b-94aa-036a08bf1107" label="lyrics-like">perénne, figurárum véterum imple¬</l><l xml:id="m-bd55117e-bb87-4ad6-a3ff-09a8b870fe82" facs="#m-1ebe0af4-5961-471f-ad37-99cf2f3587f4" label="lyrics-like">exprimere súfficit, per quod spiri¬</l><l xml:id="m-9de3ad58-f823-4333-b82b-f715e25209cc" facs="#m-116e19be-ed48-4bd6-bc65-2560c3d9c07e" label="lyrics-like">tivum, miraculórum ab ipso factó¬</l><l xml:id="m-44646476-4565-4c2d-a81c-ea7a61dce7df" facs="#m-da2033b9-4165-4282-a77b-519810931712" label="lyrics-like">tuàlis dulcédo in suo fonte gustátur;</l><l xml:id="m-f0f56ffd-5dac-4131-8002-d4a1da2fef33" facs="#m-f14aec9b-7dad-4091-984f-db6b40faff53" label="lyrics-like">rum máximum; et de sua contri¬</l><l xml:id="m-e89148d0-dacf-4292-85f3-9d8a46dce4db" facs="#m-a7c4ae68-e91f-490e-92e9-bdc7c4f73c28" label="lyrics-like">státis abséntia solátium singuláre</l><l xml:id="m-fb739743-8d33-466a-96cf-2a6501007be3" facs="#m-f9368c40-8e32-4a6f-be79-171c2456b171" label="lyrics-like">et recólitur memória illius, quam</l><l xml:id="m-be173c03-67aa-4900-b563-5af297efbeb5" facs="#m-2e7424bd-923a-4d47-84e2-7b8453ceab4b" label="lyrics-like">in sua passióne Christus monstrá-reliquit.</l><l xml:id="m-eaa03165-6e5c-4cac-8d5a-e10d02a54cff" facs="#m-a8a71e3b-599c-4d34-90f0-4cc2aefa2236" label="ambiguous">Resp-C.g</l><l xml:id="m-10c8848c-3d1f-4c4e-861f-32cc332784f7" facs="#m-5a58dc4f-8f74-48bb-af6a-66b14965ea60" label="lyrics-like">-go sum* pá-nis ví¬</l><l xml:id="m-2e91ea86-6219-4f5a-b7ff-716358b3dd15" facs="#m-e05853bc-90b6-45e8-a727-065e43b7b6f9" label="lyrics-like">tae: pâtres véstri man¬</l><l xml:id="m-dfcda634-80c1-412f-8142-715b78c197d4" facs="#m-524fc6c8-20c4-4dfe-8537-607884990daa" label="lyrics-like">et mór¬</l><l xml:id="m-c8408798-91fa-4b11-92cc-331356a2847e" facs="#m-e533fe0b-37bd-4095-83da-b2907ad6bc87" label="lyrics-like">na in desérto,</l><l xml:id="m-02c016d6-06e2-4211-9985-ec83f6982b5c" facs="#m-fb41c07f-1553-4edd-964c-f131f814ee6b" label="lyrics-like">ducavé¬ runt mán¬</l><l xml:id="m-b7681bd6-4837-4a76-9f84-252dacda9fcb" facs="#m-c29ca396-470d-4a30-98e0-c2d91bb67f2e" label="ambiguous">N 801— 88</l></lg>
            </div>
          </section>
